# 29. Poster Generation Architecture

Poster generation must be separated from scoring logic.

```text
Score Database
      ↓
Result JSON
      ↓
Poster Template
      ↓
Rendered Image
      ↓
Storage
      ↓
Share / Download
```

The poster renderer must never calculate the score independently.

The database is the source of truth.

---

# 30. AI Integration

AI is optional in v1.

AI should be used for:

* Poster artwork generation
* Caption generation
* Session summary
* Social media copy

AI must NOT be responsible for:

* Calculating scores
* Ranking archers
* Determining official results

All numerical results must come from application logic.

---

